flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8178545Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8179018Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8179816Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8180252Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8180658Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8182195Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8183012Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8183471Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8184229Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8184827Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8185504Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8186399Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8186904Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8187335Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8187526Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8187719Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8187992Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8188219Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8188729Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8188887Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8189006Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8189205Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8189513Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
