flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8193600Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8193979Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8194684Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8195486Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8196079Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8196556Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8196896Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T14:42:25.8197206Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
